 "remarks": "Lovely two bedrooms and two bath unit at Stonewood Condos. Complex and unit was fully renovated in 2019. Spacious, open floor plan for various decorating styles and deck overlooking the trees. Attractive kitchen w/light-wood colored shaker cabinets, granite counters and gas stove. The primary suite has a walk-in closet, private bath w/double sinks, quartz countertop and large tiled shower stall w/glass doors; additional large bedroom and bath w/tiled surround and flooring. Enclosed laundry area. 9' ceilings throughout. Covered & gated parking garage with one reserved space and plenty of out-door parking in lot. This is a no-smoking condo. Convenient location to shopping, restaurants, I95, Merritt and much more. Softscreen Credit Report to be paid by tenants. Applicants should have a credit score of 700+",
